# Publicly hoist type packages to the workspace-root node_modules so that
# nested dependencies resolving `react`/`react-dom` type augmentation from
# their own store location (e.g. next's own .d.ts files, phosphor icons) can
# find `@types/react`. Without this, in a workspace where @types/react is a
# dep of apps/web (not the root), those nested resolutions miss the types and
# React's base HTML/SVG attributes silently drop off component prop types.
public-hoist-pattern[]=*types*
